    "Title": "Red Wind Local Delivery Route",
    "Description": "RED WIND LINEHAUL\n'YOUR GOODS IN GOOD HANDS'\n----------------------------\n\nNeed an available independent pilot for a quick local delivery.\n\nPACKAGE FOR PICK UP\n     \u00b7 Package <EM4>#~mission(Item1|SerialNumber)</EM4> from the <EM4>~mission(Pickup1|Address)</EM4>\n\nDROP OFF LOCATION\n     \u00b7 Package <EM4>#~mission(Item1|SerialNumber)</EM4> to the <EM4>~mission(Dropoff1|Address)</EM4>\n\nTry to keep your nose clean when you're out there. If you got Red Wind packages onboard, a certain level of professionalism is appreciated. And don't forget to pack a <EM4>handheld tractor beam</EM4> to bring along. \n\n~mission(Contractor|SignOff)",
    "DisplayDescription": "RED WIND LINEHAUL\n'YOUR GOODS IN GOOD HANDS'\n----------------------------\n\nNeed an available independent pilot for a quick local delivery.\n\nPACKAGE FOR PICK UP\n     \u00b7 Package <EM4>#[Item1|SerialNumber]</EM4> from the <EM4>[Pickup1|Address]</EM4>\n\nDROP OFF LOCATION\n     \u00b7 Package <EM4>#[Item1|SerialNumber]</EM4> to the <EM4>[Dropoff1|Address]</EM4>\n\nTry to keep your nose clean when you're out there. If you got Red Wind packages onboard, a certain level of professionalism is appreciated. And don't forget to pack a <EM4>handheld tractor beam</EM4> to bring along. \n\n[Contractor|SignOff]",
